 ∇ start
 ⍝ Starts the web server for the UW Schedule Exporter application
 ⍝
 ⍝ This function initializes and starts a Jarvis web server on port 8111
 ⍝ with the following configuration:
 ⍝ - Port: 8111
 ⍝ - Namespace: web (request handlers; POST /ProcessSchedule)
 ⍝ - Payload format: JSON
 ⍝ - Static files (the page, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, favicon) from the site/
 ⍝   folder under the current directory, so run it from the repository root
 ⍝   (or /app in the Docker image)
 ⍝ - Allows both GET and POST requests
 ⍝
 ⍝ Global variables created:
 ⍝ - JSrv: Jarvis server instance for later control (stop, restart, etc.)
 ⍝
 ⍝ Usage: start
 ⍝ After running, the web interface will be available at http://localhost:8111
      JSrv←Jarvis.New(8111 web'JSON')
      JSrv.DYALOG_JARVIS_THREAD←'0'
      JSrv.Debug←0
      JSrv.HTMLInterface←(⊃1 ⎕NPARTS''),'site/'
      JSrv.AllowGETs←1
      JSrv.AllowPOSTs←1
      JSrv.Start
 ∇
